            ],
            "product_list": "/basic/v1/getProduct",
            "price_detail": "/basic/v1/getPartPriceNew",
            "region": "CN",
            "region_iso": "cn",
            "iso_language": "zh-CN",
            "brand_code": "11",
            "method": "POST",
            "fetch_mode": "http",
            "bypass_proxy": false,
            "credentials": "omit",
            "category_filter": null,
            "model_field": "marketingModelName",
            "model_code_field": "marketingModelCode",
            "deep_link": "https://support.oppo.com/cn/spare-parts-price/#/detail?marketingModelCode={code}",
            "model_match_note": "机型名匹配必须优先『精确相等』（忽略大小写/前后空白），再退回子串。cn 全表内含 'pad 5' 的机型有 3 个：OPPO Pad 5(80ab，屏幕850/11条) / OPPO Pad 5 柔光版(1ca4，屏幕950/9条) / OPPO Pad 5 Pro(3ed5，屏幕999)。旧的子串匹配会先命中『柔光版』，取到 950/9 —— 这正是此前误判『抓取不全面/价格不一致』的真因。已实测：代理与直连返回价格完全一致（Pad5 850/11 两种出口都一样），所谓『经代理取到另一套价』不成立，故 bypass_proxy=false。",
            "note": "OPPO 官网 2026 起备件价改走 REBORN 接口：POST /basic/v1/getProduct(region/regionIsoCode2/brandCode/isoLanguageCode/sourceRoute) 取全量机型(含 marketingModelCode)，再 POST /basic/v1/getPartPriceNew(+marketingModelCode) 取价；partPriceList[].childList[] 内 retailPrice=备件费、laborCostAmount=人工费(官网单列)。旧 sgp /cnw/v1/GetPartPrice(productModel=) 为遗留端点，机型覆盖不全——cn 的 OPPO Pad 5/Pad 6 等平板在旧端点查无数据、新端点有价，故 cn 必须走本模式。必须 POST，GET 返空。"
          }
        },
        "extract": {
          "api": {
            "part_field": "partName",
            "price_field": "retailPrice",
            "type_field": "lv3ClassificationName",
            "labor_field": "laborCostAmount",
            "currency_in_json": true,
            "currency": "CNY"
          }
        },
